# LiveCommerce Platform

Mobile-first AI live commerce (TikTok-style video + shopping).

## Stack

- Backend: Laravel 12, PHP 8.4, PostgreSQL, Redis, Pest, Pint, PHPStan, Scramble
- Mobile: Flutter 3, Riverpod, GoRouter, Dio, Clean Architecture
- Infra: Docker Compose (see `docker/docker-compose.yml`)

## Architecture rules

- No business logic in controllers — use Services + Repositories
- API prefix: `/api/v1/`
- Module contracts in `backend/app/Contracts/Services/`
- Follow docs in `docs/` and root architecture files (`07_ADR.md`, `08_MODULES.md`)

## Before committing

Run `scripts/qa.ps1` (Windows) or `scripts/qa.sh` (Unix). Install hooks: `scripts/install-hooks.ps1`.

## Scope

Architecture is frozen. Do not change stack without ADR. MVP = Sprints 0–7 + 14–16.
